OL,3,ABurnham in Ukraine to hand over UK
OL,4,Ablueprints to make long-range missiles
OL,5,
OL,6,FKyiv has recently stepped up long-range
OL,7,Fattacks on Moscow and other Russian
OL,8,Fregions, targeting oil refineries and
OL,9,Fwarehouses
OL,11,FUkraine and Russia continued to fire
OL,12,Fstrikes at each other overnight. Two
OL,13,Fpeople were killed in south-west Russia
OL,14,Fdue to falling debris, state news
OL,15,Fagency Tass reports
OL,17,FRussia's defence ministry says its
OL,18,Fforces attacked port infrastructure and
OL,19,Fvessels in the Odesa region - there's
OL,20,Fbeen no confirmation from Kyiv
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
