OL,3,ATrump says Canada wants 'benefits' of
OL,4,Abeing US state after trade talks
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has said
OL,8,FCanada wants "the benefits of being a
OL,9,Fstate, without being one" after trade
OL,10,Ftalks between the two countries
OL,11,Fcollapsed late on Friday.
OL,13,FThe breakdown of negotiations triggered
OL,14,Fnew 50% US tariffs on a range of
OL,15,FCanadian goods. Trump also said
OL,16,FAmerican farmers had been charged
OL,17,F"massive amounts of Tariffs" for years.
OL,19,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,20,Fcalled the fresh tariffs a
OL,21,F"miscalculation" designed to "hurt and
OL,22,Fdivide us".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
