OL,3,ANearly three million Teslas recalled in
OL,4,AChina over hidden door handles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe recalled vehicles will have a
OL,7,Fwarning label stuck on the interior
OL,8,Fdoor and receive a software update to
OL,9,Fautomatically lower the windows in a
OL,10,Fcrash.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
